{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1295.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"0e4e64ba8e122cd5b14404982ecae0d8fee4b52c7d3a5c86d22ae2d92365b45a","ja":"そして、放送当日……","zh":"然后，到了播出当天……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1295.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"f148ee66a6779551faf0d2b1d40b7d203462a8fe3b540d48b022e3e943981fdf","ja":"番組、始まりましたね。\n昴ちゃん、うまく応援できるかな……？","zh":"节目开始了呢。\n小昴能好好为她加油吗……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1295.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"013db204226dbdbef22bb698f7e51d85a1887703d852c5430856b880adb52f26","ja":"あれだけ特訓したんだし、きっと大丈夫だよ。\n大事なことはちゃんと伝えたしさ。","zh":"都进行了那样的特训，肯定没问题的。\n重要的事情我也都好好交代了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1295.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"63bb466900bf1026576708e6bd46997a6f3cf60866b8964f0beaf4b4e7b21572","ja":"ふふっ、そうですね。\nあっ！　昴ちゃんが出てきましたよ♪","zh":"呵呵，是啊。\n啊！小昴出来了哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1295.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"3b1c2ff9d98a09775334fb7a0468f3421954e9d498669b51ffc7c2466e510d49","ja":"お、応援団長をさせていただく永吉昴だ……です！\nオレ……私もすっごくドキドキしています！","zh":"由、由我来担任应援团长永吉昴是也……是的！\n我……我也超级紧张呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1295.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"471fb96bf439cb2c30a87e93da92d3f42a0c289006875aec3d4bde968bd22590","ja":"で、でも、精一杯応援するので、\n最後まで力の限り頑張ってくれ……ください！","zh":"但、但我会竭尽全力为你加油的，\n请坚持努力到最后一刻……吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1295.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"c6aeb206a4a89e6131bb3cc2c4d63dac07c9c6aa2fe96fa90cfd679823e9c610","ja":"ワアアアアアアアッ！","zh":"哇啊啊啊啊啊啊！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1295.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"26deb8c6bcd0190a4f59740787f582a8871cba05f343758f9f8e113effa399b3","ja":"ふ、フレー、フレー！　み・ん・なーっ！！","zh":"加、加油，加油！大·家——！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1295.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"af3854fe454c6a3a216ff18abea5785b8cf1890323187f3f2b1515116f6a63e2","ja":"ああっ、またフリが飛んじゃった！　\n昴、やっぱ緊張してるのかな？","zh":"啊啊，动作又忘光了！\n昂果然还是在紧张吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1295.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"9b6f0a19332179f0b7b3a7d19208605db465a11544c601caf92d2bcd004a2cfd","ja":"そうですね……。\nあっ、でも、急に動きが良くなった気がしませんか？","zh":"也是呢……。\n啊，不过，不觉得动作突然变流畅了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1295.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"f5ae5cdfba808db563957faa159b6d413db0f7114597ceb51f8c6f06a31513d8","ja":"なんだか、いつもの昴ちゃんに戻ったみたい……。","zh":"总觉得，好像变回平时的昴了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1295.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"b968feb683dce14f97ff3c246e90ff05e95a3c24a20f1ea4941359361c2af54a","ja":"（オレの応援って、選手に届いてるのかな？\nかわいさばっか気になって、ダンスもミスして……）","zh":"（我的加油声，真的有传达给选手们吗？\n净去在意可不可爱，舞蹈也跳错了……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1295.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"2944f189fd26b3c49bc35a9940d1aaee16df130a4064d1d3be3c4718150018da","ja":"（やっぱ、頑張ってる選手のことを\n第一に考えるべきだよな。よーっし……！）","zh":"（果然还是应该把努力拼搏的选手\n放在第一位考虑啊。好——嘞……！）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1295.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"243b680a90685acbd7d2f71963231f66ab80587265b15b68f4b5b3b1582f36e7","ja":"いけー！\nみんな、頑張れーーっ！！！","zh":"冲啊——！\n大家，加油啊——！！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1295.unity3d","item_key":"commands[42].text","source_sha256":"7dfefcc6b9b33b0c7599572b5a1b8b9625115db9e7abf844601f515adf7e0a36","ja":"ははっ、やっぱり昴の一生懸命な応援は\nいいよな！　こっちまで元気づけられるよ！","zh":"哈哈，昴拼尽全力的加油果然\n很棒啊！连我都深受鼓舞了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1295.unity3d","item_key":"commands[43].text","source_sha256":"886aef69fb4098c9aaadc8200a9504e972242d086a708401e5da960de8ea5007","ja":"選手の皆さんの動きも、\nなんだかさっきより、良くなってきたみたいですね♪","zh":"选手们的状态，\n好像也比刚才变得更好了呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1295.unity3d","item_key":"commands[44].text","source_sha256":"772b19b63acbbdb635259445fa8622900c91da412aead63f23013b7e94cfd60a","ja":"よーし、それじゃあアタシも……。","zh":"好～，那我也……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1295.unity3d","item_key":"commands[45].text","source_sha256":"c7085d630cd385a621271ccfc3720a4d8cd4acbaa628ccf353ffe86b5de6eba9","ja":"昴、その調子でがんばれー！","zh":"昴，保持这个势头加油啊——！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
